<%#
  Ordered editor for a profile's granted spells (CARNEVALEB-47) — spells known automatically,
  outside the normal pool pick (The Drowned Nun's Dagonite Baptism, Blood Crone's Major Arcana, …).
  Rewritten wholesale on save via Catalog::Profile#replace_granted_spells! — see
  Backoffice::ProfilesController#granted_spells_params.

  Locals: profile, all_spells, all_special_rules.
%>
<div class="js-grants-editor">
  <div class="js-grant-rows">
    <% profile.profile_granted_spells.each do |grant| %>
      <%= render "granted_spell_row", grant: grant, all_spells: all_spells, all_special_rules: all_special_rules %>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <template class="js-grant-template">
    <%= render "granted_spell_row", grant: nil, all_spells: all_spells, all_special_rules: all_special_rules %>
  </template>

  <button type="button" class="btn js-grant-add">+ Add granted spell</button>
  <div style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;">
    Almost no profile needs one of these — they're for a spell known automatically on top of (or
    instead of) the normal pool pick. Most current cases are additive and free (don't consume a
    slot); check "Consumes a slot" only if you've confirmed the rule actually spends one of the
    model's Mage(X) slots.
  </div>
</div>
